---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us & Editorial Standards | Price Drop Radar">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 prose prose-slate">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6 border border-emerald-200">
      <span>Editorial Integrity & Consumer Advocacy</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
      About Price Drop Radar
    </h1>

    <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <strong>Price Drop Radar</strong> was founded on a simple premise: helping consumers make confident, data-backed buying decisions on high-ticket equipment without paying full retail price.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Our Mission</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Unlike generic coupon sites that list thousands of low-quality clearance items, Price Drop Radar focuses exclusively on <strong>verified 90-day historic lows on premium, top-rated products</strong> ($200 to $2,500+) across Smart Home, Off-Grid Solar/Power Tools, and Maker/3D Printing tech.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">How We Verify Deals</h2>
    <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 my-6 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-emerald-600 font-black">1.</span>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
          <strong>Continuous 24/7 Price Monitoring:</strong> Our automated data pipeline tracks price fluctuations, coupon clippings, and Lightning Deals across verified manufacturers.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-emerald-600 font-black">2.</span>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
          <strong>90-Day Historic Benchmark:</strong> A deal is only flagged if it drops $\ge 15\%$ below its 90-day moving average or reaches an all-time low.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-emerald-600 font-black">3.</span>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
          <strong>Editorial Review:</strong> We strictly reject products with suspicious review profiles or high return rates, ensuring you only see hardware worth owning.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Affiliate & FTC Disclosure</h2>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
      Price Drop Radar is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. When you purchase through our links, we may earn an affiliate commission at absolutely no extra cost to you. Our editorial ratings and historical price charts are 100% independent and never influenced by advertisers.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500">
      <span>Maloney Marketing AI Ops</span>
      <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-600 font-bold hover:underline">Contact Our Team →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
